  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">這個模組為遊戲增添了可愛的小幫手！它們可以幫你搬運物品，並在你身邊並肩作戰。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">預設情況下，它們會生成在平原生態域中。（你可以透過編輯 data -&gt; biome tags 和 biome modifier 資料夾中的 json 檔案來更改此設定及其他生成設定）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以用肉類來馴服它們。如果牠們已經被馴服，你也可以用肉類來治療牠們。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以手持骨頭物品（在主手）對著牠點擊，來更改其行為模式（跟隨你、隨意走動、坐下）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以潛行並手持物品對著牠點擊，來為牠的主手裝備物品。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">或者潛行並空手對著牠點擊，來拿走牠手中的物品。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">如果你想打開牠的背包，只需在非潛行狀態下空手對著牠點擊即可。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">模組目前支援：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Forge&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;26.1. x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Fabric&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 26.1. x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Neoforge 26.1. x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1264/661/638823264467017908.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:14px\"><strong>如果你需要在 CurseForge 上取得不同版本的模組，請發送私人訊息給我</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:14px\"><strong>在 X（Twitter）上追蹤我</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此模組需要安裝 AquariusLibs 才能運作</strong></a></span></p>",
